      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Add rice, ginger, and salt to the saucepan and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to a simmer and cover; cook until rice is tender and the majority of the liquid is absorbed, 18 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
